            <div xml:id="d450">

                <pb facs="0387" n="375" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg375"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.20/552: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Wharton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-03-29T15:00:00-04:00">March 29, 1942—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>74. Your 104, March 27, 8 p.m. For McBride. Changes in Article VI approved.</p>
                <p>Department congratulates you on extremely able manner in which you have handled
                    negotiations and on successful outcome thereof.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
